## 7. Documentation sync (part of “done”)

When behavior or API wiring changes, update in the **same PR / task**:

| Change | Update |
|--------|--------|
| Any feature API | `feature_overview.md` in that feature folder |
| Screen load/refresh contract | `DOCS/qa/api_screen_sync_matrix.md` |
| Member vacation/emergency flow | `DOCS/group_vacation_emergency_member_flow.md` |
| New routes or major flows | `FEATURE_MAP.md` / `PROJECT_FLOW_MAP.md` if trace changes |

Stale docs are bugs — agents must not leave “UI-only” / “mock” notes after wiring real APIs.

---

## 8. Anti-patterns (reject in review)

- Widget → `DioClient` / `http.get` / raw URL string
- Fake `Future.delayed` instead of repository call
- Mock/preview data paths still reachable in production navigation
- Duplicated API path strings outside `ApiConstants`
- Business branching on raw API strings in presentation layer
- Success dialog / `AppSuccessScreen` shown before `BorrowProjectDetailSync.reloadBeforeSuccess` (or equivalent detail reload)
- Second full project-detail `GET` on pop when reload already ran before success (`reloadDetail: false` on return)
- New `setState` for submit/load/error flows
- `Navigator.push` with string routes
- Dead code after API integration (preview builders, TODO stubs)
- Magic numbers/colors/strings in new code when a central constant exists or should exist

---

## 9. Adding a new API feature (checklist)

1. `ApiConstants` path helpers  
2. data: model, data source, repository impl  
3. domain: entity, repository interface, use case(s)  
4. presentation: Cubit + screen; register route + `BlocProvider`  
5. DI: `inject_*.dart` + `service_locator.dart`  
6. **Loading UX** — pick one pattern from §6 table (shimmer / `AppButton.isLoading` / `AppActionDialog.showAsync` / `AppLoadingOverlay` / control loader); never POST with only `enabled: false`  
7. **Error UX** — `loadFailed` + `AppErrorView` for initial load; `AppToast` for action errors; `FailureMapper` in Cubit; `listenWhen` excludes `loadFailed`  
8. **Post-action sync** — money flows reload project detail before success UI (§5); idempotency keys for money POST (§6)  
9. `feature_overview.md` + `api_screen_sync_matrix.md` row(s)  
10. Model test(s) + Cubit test(s) for non-trivial state (idempotency, cancel contract, vote counts)  
11. `flutter analyze` + `flutter test` on touched code  
